{"sha":"96c3259b7c12a476edd208848153d3cf72a8c4f0","node_id":"C_kwDODJYi4toAKDk2YzMyNTliN2MxMmE0NzZlZGQyMDg4NDgxNTNkM2NmNzJhOGM0ZjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dapr/components-contrib/git/commits/96c3259b7c12a476edd208848153d3cf72a8c4f0","html_url":"https://github.com/dapr/components-contrib/commit/96c3259b7c12a476edd208848153d3cf72a8c4f0","author":{"name":"Jérôme Piquot","email":"jpiquot@itaneo.com","date":"2026-11-14T11:16:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"Jérôme Piquot","email":"jpiquot@itaneo.com","date":"2026-11-14T11:16:09Z"},"tree":{"sha":"055ab8a8a908eacb09828847232c94ed1c74b07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dapr/components-contrib/git/trees/055ab8a8a908eacb09828847232c94ed1c74b07f"},"message":"fix(pubsub/rabbitmq): preserve publish failures and bound cancellation\n\nPublish could return nil when the caller's context was canceled during a\nretry or reconnect wait, discarded the reconnect error, and waited for\npublisher confirmations, the channel lock and connection setup without\nobserving the caller's context.\n\n- Return an error when Publish is canceled or exhausts its retries. A\n  broker NACK or a server-sent AMQP exception from an attempt is returned\n  in preference to a later cancellation or transport error. A retry that\n  is actually confirmed still succeeds.\n- Keep reconnect errors. ACCESS_REFUSED and stopped or closed component\n  errors end the retries as terminal errors.\n- Match publisher confirmations by delivery tag and tell a real NACK apart\n  from pending confirmations completed by channel shutdown. Retain native\n  channel and connection close reasons for the Publish caller.\n- Acquire the channel lock with the caller's context and pass it to dial.\n  Dial, TLS and AMQP handshakes, channel open, confirm setup, exchange\n  declaration and blocked writes are interrupted by closing the transport\n  of the current connection generation. A new connection is installed only\n  after setup completes.\n- Preserve warnings for failed attempts and reconnect waits, and log an\n  error at retry exhaustion. Verify these messages using captured logger\n  output.\n\nPartially addresses #4764.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jérôme Piquot <jpiquot@itaneo.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","parents":[{"sha":"440b15349565bb15f7a88636477864e5a9f8cc72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dapr/components-contrib/git/commits/440b15349565bb15f7a88636477864e5a9f8cc72","html_url":"https://github.com/dapr/components-contrib/commit/440b15349565bb15f7a88636477864e5a9f8cc72"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}